Keep a shared content as empty text.
Place "123" into content.
Keep a shared lefts as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared rights as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared side as 0.

To resetleft.
Repeat while the number of items in lefts is more than 0.
Remove the last item from lefts.

To resetright.
Repeat while the number of items in rights is more than 0.
Remove the last item from rights.

To examine from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
The firstsymbol is the slice of content from start to start plus 1.
The lastsymbol is the slice of content from finish minus 1 to finish.
The chosen is empty text.
The plain is 1.
The leadzero is 0.
If firstsymbol is "0", set leadzero to 1.
The longpart is 0.
If finish minus start is more than 1, set longpart to 1.
The invalid is 0.
If leadzero is 1 and longpart is 1, set invalid to 1.
If invalid is 1, set plain to 0.
If plain is 1, set chosen to the slice of content from start to finish.
If plain is 1 and side is 0, Place chosen into lefts.
If plain is 1 and side is 1, Place chosen into rights.
For every dot from start plus 1 to finish minus 1.
The lead is the slice of content from start to dot.
The firstpart is the slice of content from start to start plus 1.
The fraction is the slice of content from dot to finish.
The decimal is 1.
The innerzero is 0.
If firstpart is "0", set innerzero to 1.
The innerlong is 0.
If dot minus start is more than 1, set innerlong to 1.
The innerbad is 0.
If innerzero is 1 and innerlong is 1, set innerbad to 1.
If innerbad is 1, set decimal to 0.
If lastsymbol is "0", set decimal to 0.
Set chosen to empty text.
Place lead into chosen.
Place "." into chosen.
Place fraction into chosen.
If decimal is 1 and side is 0, Place chosen into lefts.
If decimal is 1 and side is 1, Place chosen into rights.

The last is the last position of content.
For every cut from 1 to last.
Resetleft.
Set side to 0.
Examine from 0 with cut.
Resetright.
Set side to 1.
Examine from cut with last plus 1.
For each left in lefts.
For each right in rights.
The coordinate is empty text.
Place "(" into coordinate.
Place left into coordinate.
Place ", " into coordinate.
Place right into coordinate.
Place ")" into coordinate.
Place coordinate into answers.

For each answer in answers.
Show answer.
